    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This impressive three-bedroom duplex residence extends to approximately 120 sq. m. (1,292 sq. ft.) and offers spacious, well-designed accommodation throughout. Built in 2006, the property has been thoughtfully laid out with well-proportioned rooms that provide both comfort and functionality for modern family living. Presented in turnkey condition, the home has been exceptionally well maintained and is ready for immediate occupation. To the rear, the property benefits from a private south-facing garden, a wonderful outdoor space that enjoys sunshine throughout the day. Situated in the established and convenient area of Fairhill, the property enjoys excellent access to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, sporting facilities, and public transport links. Cork City Centre is just a short distance away. The location is particularly attractive for those working in the technology and pharmaceutical sectors, with Apple’s European Headquarters and many major employers within easy commuting distance. Excellent road connections and transport links further enhance the convenience of this sought-after residential location. Combining generous living accommodation, a private south-facing garden, and a highly convenient location, this superb turnkey home represents an excellent opportunity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n6.20m x 3.02m\r\nBright and welcoming entrance hall, tiled floor flows through to the kitchen. Understairs storage offers additional storage. \r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.51m x 3.85m\r\nSpacious room overlooking the front garden, the room benefits from timber floor and electric fire insert. \r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n4.93m x 3.11m\r\nFully fitted with floor and eye level units, benefits from integrated hob, oven and fridge/freezer. Overlooking the rear garden, there is direct access to the garden. \r\n\r\nUtility\r\n1.94m x 1.46m \r\nPlumbed for washing machine, additional storage available, access to the rear garden also. \r\n\r\nGuest W.C.\r\n1.98m x 1.37m\r\nComprises of two-piece suite. \r\n\r\nLanding:\r\nAccess to all bedroom accommodation. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.29m x 3.18m\r\nSpacious double bedroom, benefits from timber floor and built in wardrobes. \r\nEn-suite (2.58m x 1.27m)\r\nComprises of three-piece suite with shower cubicle and electric shower. The room is fully tiled. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.93m x 1.57m\r\nA fully tiled room, comprising of three-piece bath suite with electric shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.88m x 3.24m \r\nDouble bedroom overlooking the front garden, finished with timber floor and floor to ceiling window. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n4.03m x 2.63m\r\nSpacious room overlooking the front garden, finished with timber floor. \r\n\r\nGarden:\r\nThe southerly aspect rear garden offers great privacy, benefits from laid lawn, mature trees and shrubs. To the front there is off street private parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Impressive three bedroom duplex residence\r\nTurnkey condition throughout\r\nPrivate south facing  garden to the rear\r\nEasy acess to Cork city centre\r\nWalking distance to shops, schools and amenities\r\nAll mains service\r\nGas fired central heating"
      },
      {
